---
import PageLayout from "../components/PageLayout.astro";
import { formatDate, isoDate } from "../lib/format";
import { PROJECT } from "#project";

const LAST_UPDATED = new Date("2026-11-02");
---
<PageLayout title={`Privacy · ${PROJECT.productName}`} description={`How ${PROJECT.productName} handles your data.`}>
  <span class="mono-label eyebrow">Legal</span>
  <h1 class="font-display">Privacy</h1>
  <p class="updated mono-label">Last updated <time datetime={isoDate(LAST_UPDATED)}>{formatDate(LAST_UPDATED)}</time></p>
  <div class="sections">
    <section>
      <h2>Your data stays yours</h2>
      <p>
        noomers is self-hosted: every event, dashboard metric and account detail lives in
        <em>your</em> Cloudflare account — D1, R2/Iceberg and Durable Objects. We have no
        access to it, and nothing is proxied through a third party.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>What the tracker collects</h2>
      <p>
        Pageviews, custom events, engagement and scroll signals, referrer and campaign
        parameters — normalized before anything is stored. Tracking uses no cookies.
        Raw IP addresses and full user-agent strings are never persisted; visitor
        identifiers are site-scoped, hostname-scoped, salted, and rotate daily in UTC,
        so there is no cross-day, cross-site, or cross-device identity.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Your dashboard account</h2>
      <p>
        The dashboard stores your account details (name, email, password hash) managed
        by Better Auth — sessions use a signed cookie, and sign-up, sign-in and reset
        flows are protected by Cloudflare Turnstile. Deleting your account removes it
        and its data immediately.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Deleting analytics data</h2>
      <p>
        Deleting a site tombstones it and purges its Durable Object immediately;
        D1 and DO data are erased, while R2/Iceberg cleanup is a documented manual
        step in the repo docs. For privacy or data requests, email
        <a href={`mailto:${PROJECT.supportEmail}`}>{PROJECT.supportEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
<style>
  .eyebrow { display: block; }
  h1 {
    font-family: "Inter Tight Variable", "Inter Variable", -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .updated { margin-top: 10px; }
  .sections {
    margin-top: 32px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  .sections section {
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-kumo-hairline);
  }
  .sections section:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .sections h2 {
    font-family: "Inter Tight Variable", "Inter Variable", -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .sections p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-kumo-subtle);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .sections a {
    color: var(--color-kumo-brand);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
